    "note": "The architecture for EF 3.1 as a cross-method sensitivity methodology is registered here. Per-food midpoint indicator values are already carried per AGRIBALYSE v32 catalogue row in the field 'ef31_indicators_per_100g' (16 midpoints plus the precomputed 'Score unique EF 3.1'). What remains is the ETL of the JRC published normalisation factors (per 1 person x 1 year) and weighting factors (sum = 100 %) into this pack so the platform can recompute single scores from the per-food midpoints at runtime. The verification harness (_smoke_ef31_pack_verify.py) is in place and will gate any candidate set of factors against the AGRIBALYSE-stored single scores at mean relative error <= 5 %, worst-case <= 20 %; an attempt at populating these factors from memory failed the gate at mean 9.94 % / worst 52 %, confirming the workbook ETL is the right path rather than a hand-transcribed table."
  },
